SUMMARY:Live Music and Food Truck
DESCRIPTION:Live Music & Food Truck at Great Bear Vineyards in Davis  Saturday\, September 12 | 11am–5pm\nSpend your Saturday soaking up the vineyard views\, sipping award-winning wines\, enjoying delicious Mediterranean-inspired food\, and listening to live music! Sounds like a pretty perfect afternoon to us. \nYour ticket includes a glass of wine + live music featuring the fabulous Ericka Davis! \n Live Music: Ericka Davis | 12:30–3pmNamed Northern California’s hottest musician by Fringe Magazine\, Ericka Davis brings powerhouse vocals and vibrant energy to the vineyard. Her set blends classic pop favorites with original songs\, creating the perfect soundtrack for sipping\, relaxing\, and maybe even a little dancing! \n Food: The Greek Wagon | 12–4pmWe’re excited to welcome The Greek Wagon back to Great Bear! Dig into delicious Greek-inspired favorites including gyros\, falafel\, Greek-inspired burgers\, and fries. \n Ticket Includes:• Glass of wine• Live music• An afternoon at the vineyard!\nBring your friends\, grab a seat on the lawn\, and make a Saturday of it! \nPlease note: Food is available for purchase from The Greek Wagon. To support our local food truck partner\, please do not bring outside food.\nWe’ll see you at the vineyard!
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/live-music-and-food-truck-21/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Highway128PressTrip_GreatBearVineyards_2024_MaxWhittaker_12-Copy-scaled-OoIRnT.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
