SUMMARY:Yoga Night at Great Bear Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Yoga & Wine Night at Great Bear Vineyards in Davis Wednesday\, September 16 | 6–8pm\nOne Wednesday a month\, we’re trading the usual evening routine for yoga\, wine\, vineyard views\, and good company! \nJoin Fit4Mom Davis-Woodland and Great Bear Vineyards for a relaxing evening of movement and fun. Our talented Fit4Mom instructors will guide you through an easy-to-moderate Vinyasa flow set to groovy tunes and tailored to your skill level. \nAs class winds down\, take a moment to slow down with an inspirational\, original meditation. Then comes the best part… \nWine time! Sit back\, relax\, and enjoy your included glass of Great Bear wine while soaking up the beautiful vineyard setting. Take a stroll through the lavender fields\, spread out a picnic\, or simply hang out and connect with friends—old and new. \nBecause honestly… a little yoga followed by a glass of wine sounds like the perfect way to spend a Wednesday evening! \n Ticket Includes: Yoga Class First Glass of Wine\nWhat to Bring: Yoga mat Water Picnic goodies if you’d like Towel Card or cash for an extra glass or bottle Light jacket or sweater\nCome stretch\, sip\, unwind\, and enjoy a beautiful evening at the vineyard! \nPresented by Fit4Mom Davis-Woodland & Great Bear Vineyards
URL:https://visitdavis.org/event/yoga-night-at-great-bear-vineyards-3/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visitdavis.org/wp-content/uploads/Great-Bear-Vineyards_23GBV-drone-scaled-zK0eUQ.jpg
